  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1510.04 Explosive Selection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1510.04 Explosive Selection. Explosive products shall be selected that are:\n\n(a) Appropriate for site conditions and safe blast execution; and\n\n(b) Have the appropriate water resistance for the site conditions present.\n\nSource. #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
